third_party/catalyst
====================

This directory contains two classes adopted from catalyst v21.5 (PyPI release;
GitHub tag `v21.05`):

- `_DatasetFromSampler`
- `DistributedSamplerWrapper`

  https://github.com/catalyst-team/catalyst/blob/v21.05/catalyst/data/sampler.py

